<LegalLayout
  title="Refunds"
  description="Klyna tools are free. There is nothing to refund."
  heading="Refunds"
>
  <p>
    Every Klyna tool is currently free. There is no checkout, no subscription, no trial. So
    there is nothing to refund and no refund flow.
  </p>

  <p>
    If a paid tier ever launches &mdash; for example a hosted service, a managed install, or a
    pro add-on &mdash; this page will be updated with the actual refund terms before the first
    charge is taken. The "Last updated" date at the top will tell you when.
  </p>

  <h2>You spent money on something Klyna-related anyway?</h2>
  <p>
    Sometimes people buy hosting, an AI API key, or a service from someone else to use with
    Klyna. Those refunds are between you and that vendor &mdash; we cannot refund money we did
    not receive.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you genuinely paid Klyna for something (a sponsorship, a consulting day, a swag order),
    email <a href="mailto:hello@klyna.dev">hello@klyna.dev</a> and we will sort it out.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
